* text eol=lf
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.zip binary

# Built, committed viewer bundle: Vite's build output mixes line endings, so
# the eol=lf rule above rewrites it on every add/commit and a hash taken right
# after `npm run build:viewer` never matches a hash taken after checkout.
# Treat it as an opaque blob so git stops touching its bytes.
tools/app/web/dist/viewer.html binary
tools/app/web/dist-app/index.html binary
